 `   --lint               `Enable the linter; needs either Viewer or HTML output. HBRK
 `   --version            `Print the program version and exit.
 ATX3 
+ATX3 CONVERTING DOCUMENTS
+ATX3 
+Given an output format option, `mdview` converts the file and exits instead of HBRK
+opening the viewer, which makes it a command-line Markdown converter. Output HBRK
+goes to standard output unless `--output` redirects it to a file.
+ATX3 
+`    mdview --text . README.md` HBRK
+`                      `Print decorated text on standard output. HBRK
